Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:13:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Include <algorithm> in filesystemarchive.cpp

It calls std::transform but relied on another header to include
<algorithm>, which no longer happens with GCC 14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 components/vfs/filesystemarchive.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/components/vfs/filesystemarchive.cpp b/components/vfs/filesystemarchive.cpp
index 6eef4b9..608323e 100644
--- a/components/vfs/filesystemarchive.cpp
+++ b/components/vfs/filesystemarchive.cpp
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 #include "filesystemarchive.hpp"
 
+#include <algorithm>
+
 #include <boost/filesystem.hpp>
 
 #include <components/debug/debuglog.hpp>
